\u0627\u0628\u062a\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u062b\u0627\u0646\u064a</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;\u0627\u0630\u0627 \u0627\u062d\u062a\u062c\u062a \u0645\u0633\u0627\u0639\u062f\u0629 \u0641\u064a \u0627\u0644\u0627\u0644\u063a\u0627\u0632 \u0627\u0642\u0631\u0627 \u0648\u0631\u0642\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0647\u0646\u062a 3 \u0645\u0631\u0627\u062a \u0648\u0628\u062a\u0638\u0647\u0631 \u0645\u0633\u0627\u0639\u062f\u0629&quot;\u00a0</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot; \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0628 \u0627\u0644\u062c\u0632\u0621 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0648\u0644 \u0643\u0627\u0645\u0644 \u0642\u0628\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u0634\u0627\u0628\u062a\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u062b\u0627\u0646\u064a \u0648\u064a\u0641\u0636\u0644 \u062a\u0643\u0648\u0646 \u0628\u062c\u0644\u0633\u0629 \u0648\u062d\u062f\u0629 &quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;\u0627<strong>\u0644\u0644\u0639\u0628\u0629 \u062a\u062d\u062a\u0648\u064a \u0639\u0644\u0649 \u0645\u0647\u0645\u0627\u062a \u0625\u0644\u0632\u0627\u0645\u064a\u0629 \u0644\u062a\u062c\u0631\u0628\u0629 \u0645\u062a\u0643\u0627\u0645\u0644\u0629. \u062a\u062c\u0627\u0647\u0644\u0643 \u0627\u0644\u062a\u0639\u0644\u064a\u0645\u0627\u062a \u0642\u062f \u064a\u0624\u062f\u064a \u0644\u062a\u062c\u0631\u0628\u0629 \u063a\u064a\u0631 \u0645\u0631\u0636\u064a\u0629&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>\u0627\u0644\u0644\u0639\u0628\u0629 \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0644\u063a\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong> <br> <br><u><strong>&quot; for better gameplay turn off vsync &quot;</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>  </strong><br><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485570/extras/d67ffe2c6de2d26a156e182095b96193.avif?t=1749315680\" data-has-big width=800 height=262 /></span><strong>  </strong><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><u><strong>\u201cThis game requires understanding Arabic to fully experience its story and gameplay.\u201d</strong></u><strong> <u></u></strong><br><br><br><br><br><br><strong> </strong> <br><strong>Abu Fanous is a psychological horror game that explores the fear of the unknown and the mysteries of family secrets. The story begins when Younis wakes up in his grandfather\u2019s house to the sound of loud knocking. He finds a note stating that his family has left for a wedding without him. But soon, he realizes that something is terribly wrong\u2026 Shadows move, eerie sounds echo through the halls, and puzzles lead him to uncover the truth about his grandfather  </strong> <br><strong>  </strong> <br><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> \u2022 Deep psychological horror experience with an eerie atmosphere and cryptic clues.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> \u2022 Mysterious storyline with a layered narrative </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> \u2022 Challenging puzzles that require keen observation and logical thinking to unravel the truth.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> \u2022 Immersive sound design that enhances the sense of fear and unease.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> \u2022 Exploration of an old, haunted house filled with disturbing details and hidden secrets.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> \u2022 Dynamic horror events </strong><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><strong>In the second chapter of \u201cAbu Fanous\u201d, the story returns to the night before the wedding, where Younis finds himself trapped between his memories and mysterious events unfolding around him. His journey begins in his small apartment, but something feels off. Strange noises, cryptic messages, and ancient writings\u2026 Every detail holds meaning, and every decision leads him closer to uncovering a new piece of the puzzle.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This chapter offers a deeper psychological horror experience, with more detailed environments and events that will make you rethink everything you thought you knew about the story.</strong><br><strong></strong><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><strong>If you love psychological horror and deep mysteries, prepare for a terrifying experience that will make you question everything around you\u2026</strong><br></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485570/extras/d901b8901726e6c05e50e3cc90b1307c.poster.avif?t=1749315680\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485570/extras/d901b8901726e6c05e50e3cc90b1307c.webm?t=1749315680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485570/extras/d901b8901726e6c05e50e3cc90b1307c.mp4?t=1749315680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u0623\u0628\u0648 \u0641\u0627\u0646\u0648\u0633 \u0647\u064a \u0644\u0639\u0628\u0629 \u0631\u0639\u0628 \u0646\u0641\u0633\u064a \u062a\u0633\u0644\u0637 \u0627\u0644\u0636\u0648\u0621 \u0639\u0644\u0649 \u0627\u0644\u062e\u0648\u0641 \u0645\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u062c\u0647\u0648\u0644 \u0648\u0627\u0644\u063a\u0645\u0648\u0636 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0627\u0626\u0644\u064a. \u062a\u0628\u062f\u0623 \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0635\u0629 \u0639\u0646\u062f\u0645\u0627 \u064a\u0633\u062a\u064a\u0642\u0638 \u064a\u0648\u0646\u0633 \u0641\u064a \u0645\u0646\u0632\u0644 \u062c\u062f\u0647 \u0639\u0644\u0649 \u0635\u0648\u062a \u0637\u0631\u0642 \u0628\u0627\u0628 \u0642\u0648\u064a\u060c \u0644\u064a\u062c\u062f \u0648\u0631\u0642\u0629 \u062a\u062e\u0628\u0631\u0647 \u0623\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0627\u0626\u0644\u0629 \u0630\u0647\u0628\u062a \u0644\u062d\u0636\u0648\u0631 \u0632\u0641\u0627\u0641 \u0628\u062f\u0648\u0646\u0647. \u0644\u0643\u0646\u0647 \u0633\u0631\u0639\u0627\u0646 \u0645\u0627 \u064a\u062f\u0631\u0643 \u0623\u0646 \u0647\u0646\u0627\u0643 \u0634\u064a\u0626\u064b\u0627 \u062e\u0627\u0637\u0626\u064b\u0627 \u0641\u064a \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0646\u0632\u0644\u2026 \u0638\u0644\u0627\u0644 \u062a\u062a\u062d\u0631\u0643\u060c \u0623\u0635\u0648\u0627\u062a \u063